-- title:
--   Fourth-power weighted variation of the natural theta weight
-- statement:
--   Let $C\ge0$ and $2\le a\le b\le X$ be natural numbers with $\log X/\log a\le5$. Let $\Theta_X(m)$ be the natural Saias main term at $(\lfloor X/m\rfloor,m)$ divided by $\log m$. Then
--   $$\sum_{m=a}^{b-1}|\Theta_X(m+1)-\Theta_X(m)|\frac{Cm}{\log^4m}\le16\left(\frac{CX(2+\log b)}{\log^5a}+\frac{CX(1+\log b)}{\log^6a}\right)+\frac{CX}{\log^5a}\left(1+\frac2{\log a}\right).$$
--
--   This controls the lower-face Abel weight using the same logarithmic precision as the selector estimate.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/ShouqiaoW/erdos/blob/61325b10bbdc29f4fb5e0618b414b9f2189333ad/390/lean/Erdos390/WholePaper/RoughSaiasSharpCorrectionTarget.lean#L1449-L1573

